  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ecfbcd95428dd32da48c58e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的没有被我拖累吗……？\r\n我老是给人惹麻烦……呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da732ead2903a84415423dd163b76cf67a9c1cefbe587317a66d60ad847ba490",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e42bd1ef04ae2df57d6419f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我老是这么冒失，真的很对不起……\r\n对不起，我不该出生的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3f94c958095cab4940770cccd2fbbaf1a914cb774c1992ab9a1158ff19f697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c3cf95856f672c367090f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜呜……\r\n我果然是个没用又没救的\r\n慢吞吞赛马娘，呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8889ebd8b4c284acbcb6b0b622784c885e7a66c9382b545b8d485d71a39adec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21eeb9d2e94ffeb87c1c1d66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……请问我们是要报名参赛吗？\r\n……果然是要参赛的吧。\r\n没用的人就该做更多的努力才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6af9709c45dbba8c8aa2f6b1892ba2d53da993dd54a92fca64ebd845ee9c7e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a3363b24aebc17817b8694",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起、对不起……！\r\n我要跑起来……要参赛才行……\r\n可是身体却动不了了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b48a4149c9f04e18a48eb18b8f812595ada7731f6171d867c5452999cd295e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:448cffec033f1d97d9477d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常好……！\r\n应、应该吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00b220e467fc72c52158f5ac26420454da0c99ff43c54e37ae7afbf71caecba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d20923220e4f8550225e3f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈、哈──哈哈哈哈！\r\n……我、我今天的干劲，\r\n就像好歌剧一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffc2ba8bf4c6043f48997fa2bc65351a65c9f053f1d034aa056fc2615a54d079",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2e34b7b692357f6b249251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该准备的事情都有做好了……\r\n感觉会有比平常更好的成绩……\r\n应该可以……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48ebd542711c0d8c4871d182eac3c5b1c69bb5a60559a16e9ada1444bbb326d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42726321191ee409e11f2998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也有可能是我想太多了，\r\n但我觉得自己的状态好像还可以。\r\n……虽然只是稍微有这种感觉～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5833e46a7373ac8612e09781682954a067c19db5460d4c55406f6f43b6f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451f0c1bd631eccb6d28811a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我的表现来说，\r\n应该算是做得还算不错了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a77f18a8e3d47413103d441ce8d7b84ad3a27b10355912929fb605da802594",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628c8dd0c34c4a6e9be4ef63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照这种感觉的话……\r\n只要小心一点，\r\n应该结果就不会太坏……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d00d88ba6b5f8658e917ff8b5a75a8990f1afaa435e25e8fd332d0c92cd552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac14032a9eca585ae05d1a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好的！要参赛对吧……！\r\n我会小心不要失败的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8438871d5ed9a877dcd2f074fdbea8ba504590b05fdb5a6e53c95b96ed616e39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58cafd9c2a703d86aea4a479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我应该能有正常的表现吧～\r\n……只要衣服不要卡到闸门的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdff69251fdfb12e18ed4f19669436374bb54733acb5d4636b4174065b5f5c23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0213b2d4a8b0a3c61f1792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘶……呼……\r\n冷静……冷静下来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "488309d42c8b45e18554b9de3c33a2495ae4b87bf32c9e462be78aa0918533a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53db655342ed959bf9ad8c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照这种状态的话……\r\n不，没事……！\r\n我还是要尽力拼拼看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c064cb8cc2b15058bf24776281bc2195abc261c28e660d48dd433f238a893df0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed3771fba15e31e76de087f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在这种状态……\r\n我可能有点担心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfbb6fcc988623dcf8367adc928a08019b24db2558b9c2eb49e9e98ba90f1706",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b07a55cc72ca2d651463d1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱、抱歉……\r\n感觉好像发挥不出实力……\r\n啊，但我还是会全力以赴的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03371cb82fa2eb73dfb050ba692e14436a6b93552cbafdccdeec5f73d290837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ec2cb781d9f31690bc5265",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的状态吗～？完全就是……\r\n非常糟糕啊……\r\n但我还是会想办法努力的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e397056064c7349ed7433c5f17a6f08838e7f8bbf7734a7f999609105991a40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34638b3907b082a88247ed60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态很糟糕……\r\n但或许会有奇迹发生也不一定……\r\n所以我会努力跑跑看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5796175dfa219bd3d429be88c94a436629bbfdfa920d73ad23a777dbc27bcf17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a88a8dc999d344be41e52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态很差……只要不放弃的话，\r\n或许就还有机会吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7756578495051224777ac78bb48e92bbf2241fb141b0a329a389aaa94c843d25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cce25dbb447c581e0a433822",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f28bc774b7880ab5e1c2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能做得到吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a98d9a73091f0cc0d77ab09b7886be598d8c13965df689b01d01ec0d19fb65fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613051726f2b9b8e82a1e774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静下来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c35aa9e21c3747b3ab2e7c9c448169497ea5644bba731edaecfbd1788279b34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d10a16f06068041f3d11bc7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "念书我也不会放弃的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "566d4b6b3ec8717348b556c35f73e4fbe4ab77599efc5fc5aad74fb12ed372d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6c005f52b196b895ead83e",
