      "uid": "zhcn:6b09d34bc7af82b908135b66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我赢了吧……嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "145762eb3f46fd47b3475656a4e483b903f84b045e903121760d1c3d177026d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b057667af69aa56d1c0001b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我我我、我要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d36c931a5716233ea83a82eee9bf7291938c2c381873b9f3a290f14bd5771b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019d4ced63bed50fac6bc787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天我也……好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "429d66de08990afa2038d36f385beef333aade00db90eed0eeb4d81344b3f405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b383903db53251430362e9da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新、新的一年……\r\n希、希望我能\r\n带给大家幸福……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35bc3a4ddce046dedfd807185137fe725ff593891292462d353c8ef3864924ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39064a2cec35745e612c429c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能跟数码一起准备圣蹄祭……\r\n总觉得、非常开心呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f54fd8f1a468391ef4790d977d0ca7962e93e6e5b4bb070c76963fecd882254f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e9c8a1bb603594da5d1eb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎……怎么办……\r\n因为我太笨手笨脚，\r\n又给大家添麻烦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5db822cf228d7333951c2177bba20cb0f69733b4848739ba686a16172e1b8cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f115dd29c3d5a5b78bb898e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是多崇拜的对象，大家一定\r\n都是来自同一间学园的伙伴……\r\n这样讲起来、感觉好惶恐啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c89d325ee72ef040fef37d87ef0810b85a3560999df51713a9c4209ba4bd6176",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09fbddec2273cbabcc4d7ca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜～好、好紧张～！\r\n不过……到今天为止，\r\n我已经做了所有能做的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c279160fdf391b2942cb13e3570c19a07a267c1cd82a4f038fbe68b061f5a4cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60434389c2bd4f7df380d41a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～！咦？啊哇！咿～！啊！？\r\n呼……啊…………好～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b2f984b2b408e4e7dbe70e60fa87f7019b92ffef686665a4460eb0dbdd850f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53e24cb4422e7c2a4fd6d0f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动辛苦了～！\r\n我、我是否真的有\r\n带给大家幸福了呢……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b1b715623ef6093bdf7b218be3d61ff52efcf8814694b26846b2c03a57be26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e754369b95692f9b9de78c84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我我我、我很难吃喔～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60fc0af076a389c571f7580de200357dcdaacd37f0c0eca7a8b2ed959f50e35a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0375300c3750fd0494d75501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，请走这边……呜哇！？别别别、\r\n别过来～～！啊……什么嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ef0c90dd7e628dd2ae8c4a0a35d130608775b319149df3651879d48fdf95b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d696642b11454a1433aec49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开、开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "251233e556916aa4b496b39f13ad4f0d21589198a9d8b77448a99e87ec169f83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b835b6aa8e11c7bc0f8b50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c0e289b12136c3f6eead09b3a329bfd00ae8a866a53a0ed2c4ef9f21d9bde4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93fad9536c317794d36737d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a45daa99d47f792f2e008a4d0f0b1b9ac1f29d1a3b8800e80d5d08a8e678d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
