      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5cdcb87642b84ba83cd949",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……已经要开始了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4ee25744900b68e1f3e1dbb83bcd3281f508858c1934eea3209328027fe032",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245dbff7939f400113b5bb78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我会认真唱的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bdbf60375861dd0987a1bfb21a6c1c22f47ab8bdc699c86132c39cda4f7ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6a142673f1aacdc505e550c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不、不介意让我帮忙的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed15f481bec0700e5ba58ce663c8b2368bc71913d86f262661d60a88014fd222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7b944c5c3c55a2c73c8aa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员对我说的话……\r\n今后我也会当作我的护身符，\r\n好好珍惜，不会忘记的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c72a905b292d8690368b078a38be2c679cb4b62d21daa0865abb3d9a92b6efc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:833f3b9a86b1783196776845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在也还是觉得像做梦一样～\r\n我竟然穿着特雷森学园的制服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8958b4edbac03565a28d884c1d89d2e690e57b803b930a9d916223309b5ab70a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3362be9d7047ab340af893e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着蓬松衣服的时候，\r\n连心情也会跟着变轻松呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc428a52975873a50d56ef7ac098a1c18a363d68504b5b953c98875d77af383c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44bd7ce8f41f8fefd4c2398",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么样……？\r\n我会不会驾驭不了决胜服……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8885b9246356cf84cb0b7c4c42c82ce158ea4a4a841945189079ad6fc0fb3007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f0931537eed32015d18019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个缎带已经是第五条了……\r\n因为常常不小心被我勾破……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3d4e8c0bdfd48935d9472c084ec0cafa5a1b99c82c36d480a36a246cb4b30e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ea997103d218f616e8f14dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……Live的时候，\r\n要小心不要跌倒弄脏了衣服……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e702240ae1253e1de8e90715f94d987421864f62f088e616ac3b5dd3f3ccb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba4ef711092eb1f4b98c63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包包里装着创可贴和绷带。\r\n这样就不怕冒失受伤了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe7a5bb8082758ef3b2d5d5ecbb294526c72d9de2c966bd8d8a0791a7d16a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d55d598a1c0e6a68224bf9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着灯笼的火焰，会感到很放松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c4c220cb09b651db63fd136674b8401f1d4595e12ed522215e448af400587b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf23078752d2f1a0f5e57078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收在袖子里的点心，都掉出来了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09bcd13f5ef4290a8dcbc9ac09edaddda0b35a961346dfa3a6262ecc4f78653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb035cd62332e32cf3ff3f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93402554c851c294fa17a86e09545ac448b5c8b1596635e17c61e567ce865ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
